  "prefLabel": "Mec 302.10 Armed Services Applicants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 302.10 Armed Services Applicants. An individual who is in the armed forces as defined in RSA 21:50, II, and who is applying for licensure, shall provide proof of direct relevant training and experience acquired in the armed forces that demonstrates that the individual has completed both the educational and field experience requirements set forth in these rules.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.13); (formerly Saf-Mec 302.12); ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36 (formerly Mec 302.12)",
